text It's the same old path to school.
text The sun is shining down on me as always. Anyone wearing the same uniform is nowhere to be found...
text It's a very familiar scene.
text I wonder how many more times will I get to see this.
text Actually, just what will I be doing a year from now?
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm...
